# Chapter 6. Developing a Feedforward Neural Network

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:nx, "1.0.0"},
  {:kino, "0.19.1"},
  {:kino_vega_lite, "0.1.13"}
])

# Reference configuration: CPU, f64, no native backend required.
Nx.default_backend(Nx.BinaryBackend)
